    "description": "",
    "product_description": "<h3>Product Benefits</h3><div class=\"benefits-content\"><p>High Sun Protection<br/>Broad spectrum SPF 50 PA+++ shields skin from UVA/UVB rays, photo-aging, and tanning.<br/>Works well even under makeup and humid conditions.</p><p>? Hydration Without Stickiness<br/>Aloe Vera, Hyaluronic Acid, and Panthenol lock in moisture and keep skin hydrated all day.</p><p>? No White Cast<br/>The SPF blend and lightweight emulsion ensure it blends seamlessly into all Indian skin tones.</p><p>? Skin Soothing &amp; Repair<br/>Cucumber, Green Tea, and Allantoin cool and calm irritated or sun-exposed skin.</p><p>\u2728 Barrier Strengthening<br/>Niacinamide reduces dullness, controls oil, and improves overall skin texture.</p></div><h3>How to Use &amp; Rituals</h3><div class=\"usage-content\"><p>When to Use:</p><p>Every morning after cleansing and serum.</p><p>Reapply every 3\u20134 hours if outdoors.</p><p>How to Use:</p><p>Take a pea-sized amount.</p><p>Apply evenly on face, neck, and exposed areas.</p><p>Use as the last step in your skincare routine (before makeup).</p><p>Best For:</p><p>All skin types (especially oily &amp; combination)</p><p>Men &amp; women who dislike heavy sunscreens</p><p>Office goers, travelers, and daily commuters</p></div><h3>Ingredients</h3><p class=\"ingredients-list\"><em>Aqua (Distilled Water), Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice (Aloe Vera), Niacinamide, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Octocrylene, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane (Avobenzone), Benzophenone-3, BHT, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Extract, Camellia Sinensis (Green Tea) Leaf Extract, Allantoin, Xanthan Gum, Gluconolactone (and) Sodium Benzoate (Geogard Ultra), Fragrance (Natural), Lactic Acid (for pH adjustment).</em></p><div class=\"product-guarantee\"><p><strong>100% Vegan &amp; Cruelty Free</strong> | <strong>Formulated for Indian Skin</strong> | <strong>Safe &amp; Non-Toxic</strong></p></div>",
    "product_short_description": "<div class=\"advaya-product-details\">   <p class=\"lead-summary\">     <strong>Ultra-light SPF50 that shields, hydrates, and calms skin       with zero white cast.</strong>   </p>      <h3><br/></h3><div class=\"product-guarantee\">   </div> </div>",
